[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0010","text":"啊，我们的舞台，上新闻了呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0020","text":"哼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0030","text":"圆香……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0040","text":"……怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0050","text":"啊……圆、圆香酱，对这种东西\n不会感动吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0060","text":"嘛，也没什么特别的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0070","text":"这、这样啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0080","text":"圆香酱，明明拍得最大呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0090","text":"没眼光的摄影师……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32200200_02_0100","text":"…………？"}]
